Ratio":0.40835},{"ratio":0.99,"watchRatio":0.39625},{"ratio":1,"watchRatio":0.3913}],"script":{"source_path":"n627K2isOpo.en-orig.vtt","words":216,"wpm":null,"lang":"en","chapters":[],"blocks":[{"sec":0,"text":"The moment you say caste, I think there"},{"sec":1.7,"text":"is an impression of this pyramid, right?"},{"sec":3.2,"text":"Like there is a Brahmin on top, then the"},{"sec":5.3,"text":"king is listening to the Brahmin, and"},{"sec":7.1,"text":"both the Brahmin and king are trying to"},{"sec":8.6,"text":"manipulate everyone else. Or if you look"},{"sec":10.5,"text":"at like other sort of variations, right?"},{"sec":12.7,"text":"There is a merchant, which is like the"},{"sec":14.8,"text":"Vaishya the category, right? So there is"},{"sec":16.6,"text":"a merchant, there is a priest, and then"},{"sec":18.3,"text":"there is a royalty. All of these are"},{"sec":20.1,"text":"trying to pollute and then trying to"},{"sec":22.1,"text":"exploit everyone else below, right? So"},{"sec":23.9,"text":"there's a lot of these sort of things"},{"sec":25.3,"text":"that also come in when you say caste"},{"sec":27.4,"text":"system. And I think those are things"},{"sec":29,"text":"that we need to contest. Also, we need"},{"sec":30.8,"text":"to contest some of these ideas around"},{"sec":32.7,"text":"the categorization, like I said, right?"},{"sec":34.4,"text":"Like if you study how census was"},{"sec":36.9,"text":"conducted, let's say in the late 19th"},{"sec":39.2,"text":"century, early 20th century, all of"},{"sec":40.8,"text":"that,"},{"sec":41.3,"text":">> [music]"},{"sec":41.5,"text":">> some of these like very very strict"},{"sec":43,"text":"categorizations sort of came about then,"},{"sec":45.8,"text":"where it is almost like you had a bunch"},{"sec":49,"text":"of pigeonholes, and you are trying to"},{"sec":50.4,"text":"force fit people into that. So you put"},{"sec":52.8,"text":"somebody into one caste, and then you"},{"sec":54.3,"text":"say you are this and nothing else."}],"text":""}}